// Syncthing ignore rules
// .git excluded: two machines syncing the same .git index causes corruption
// (this bit us on 2026-08-26 with claude-cowork/aicos-ozone). Git authority = MacBook.
// node_modules / .next excluded: regenerable build artifacts, no reason to sync.
.git
node_modules
.next
.DS_Store
.stversions
.stfolder
*.sync-conflict-*
